
## [6d395c9] Q28-1 authorization request carries an S256 challenge, never the verifier
OK   start returns 200 with an authorization URL: 200
FAIL URL has code_challenge_method=S256 and a 43-character challenge: [null,0] (expected ["S256",43])
OK   neither the URL nor the response body carries a verifier: [false,false]
OK   the owner's own callback succeeds and stores a grant: [200,"AUTHORIZED","ACTIVE"]
