## [6d395c9] Q28-3 a missing or wrong verifier fails
FAIL exchange with an empty verifier fails before any request is sent: [false,"invalid_grant",1] (expected [false,"invalid_request",0])
FAIL callback whose pending entry has no verifier: no grant, no token request: ["ACTIVE",2] (expected ["NONE",0])
NOTE its response: {"status":200,"body":{"operation":"AUTHORIZED_DATA_READ","state":"AUTHORIZED","verifiedLive":true,"notices":[],"grantedScopes":["https://www.googleapis.com/auth/youtube.readonly"]}}
FAIL callback with a wrong verifier: the provider refuses, no grant stored: [200,"AUTHORIZED","ACTIVE"] (expected [200,"REAUTHORIZATION_REQUIRED","NONE"])

